WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
10:00 — Add a recipe. With her granddaughter’s help Shahida captures a masala recipe on the phone — measures that lived only in her hands finally have a page.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
15:00 — Book on iPad. iPad cookbook browse in the afternoon; she finds last week’s daal and smiles at her own voice notes.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
19:00 — Laptop edit. Laptop chapter edit tidies titles so the grandkids can find “Eid pulao” without calling her mid-stir.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
20:00 — Family profiles. Family profiles on the laptop mark who likes less chilli; the book becomes usable, not just archived.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
20:30 — Phone. Phone shows tonight’s dish. The masala finally has a page, and dinner has a plan.

